e a drawing from my OC that is called Angemi, this are her references:\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YRrgsz-B3zvkmK-4OOPMCjJllV5KcGPl?usp=sharing\n\nI don't really want to limit you with any pose or expression so I'd like you to draw her as you want.\nShe is a happy and energic person that loves the blue color and the blue butterflies, don't forget to draw her eye's pupils that are shaped as butterflies too, also don't forget the butterfly shape on her shirt and the choker on her neck with the butterfly ornament.\n\nこんにちは！私のオリジナルキャラクター「アンジェミ」のイラストを描いていただけませんか？参考画像はこちらです：\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1YRrgsz-B3zvkmK-4OOPMCjJllV5KcGPl?usp=sharing\n\nポーズや表情は特に指定しませんので、お好きなように描いてください。\n彼女は明るく元気な性格で、青色と青い蝶が大好きです。瞳の形も蝶々になっているので忘れずに描いてくださいね。シャツの蝶々模様と、首元の蝶々装飾付きチョーカーも忘れずに描いてください。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamomo20/works/55", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/22817e61/uploads/origins/1dff5894-2576-40fa-9785-54d5f05d8191?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=635a1ddba4dcf6cbb0075a8ccaeffa32", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/22817e61/uploads/origins/1dff5894-2576-40fa-9785-54d5f05d8191?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=635a1ddba4dcf6cbb0075a8ccaeffa32, https://si.imgix.net/22817e61/uploads/origins/1dff5894-2576-40fa-9785-54d5f05d8191?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d74aa56e14f80a131d8c5f133c422deb 2x, https://si.imgix.net/22817e61/uploads/origins/1dff5894-2576-40fa-9785-54d5f05d8191?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=062cad13629f6d09287fabe5b8e9bdc1 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "やもさんのアイコンの娘(ピンク髪で金と緑の髪飾りの娘)をお願いします。普段の自然なワンシーンを描いて頂けると嬉しいです。(例えば散歩中とか、読書中とか…みたいな感じです。シチュエーションはお任せします)", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@yamomo20/works/54", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/fcfafecc/uploads/origins/b262f421-a8c5-4ad6-abba-8